NODE id=matrix/cody/internal/mode.Policy.OrchestratorLLM kind=method
  digest=b3:eb127afd49b1654eaa4388a9dc55b5b8205a5f5dd23c74ad921d6e41dae8df79 file=cody/internal/mode/mode.go range=163:176 lang=go exported=true byte_range=6176:6717
  sig=func (p Policy) OrchestratorLLM(gatewayURL, actorDID string) mcllm.Config
  doc=OrchestratorLLM builds the orchestrator-role client config: the stronger\nmodel, cold temperature (planning + decision adjudication), the cody slot.\nThis is the COLD judge for decision phases — divergent candidates are\ngenerated hot (DecisionLLM) and picked cold here.
